WEBVTT

00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:31.945
unfold the crooked-crease 
fold of art class paper.

00:00:31.945 --> 00:00:36.306
I am in my living room.
It is June.

00:00:36.306 --> 00:00:39.959
Inside of the card, 
there is one long word, and then

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.780
Estefani’s name:

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.730
Loisfoeribari Estefani

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.702
Loisfoeribari?

00:00:48.702 --> 00:00:50.062
Loisfoeribari:

00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:55.242
The scientific, 
Latinate way of saying hibiscus.

00:00:55.242 --> 00:00:59.082
Loisforeribari: A direction, as in:
are you going

00:00:59.082 --> 00:01:03.402
North? South? East?
West? Loisfoeribari?